--- !u!114 &6021575310368683895
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2991652199720112011}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e571bc2f43371044daec5cc488e2652d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogues:
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - Hi there! Is there anything to help you?
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - Buy something then maybe I can give you a hint related to your adventure.
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - Sorry! You don't have enough coins. I understand but I can't make a favor to
      you.
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - That's all I can say. I wish you good fortune.
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - 'When you open Glossary, you will see I, II, III buttons at top-right. '
    - You can drag weapons between them. So you equip off-hand to your desired weapon
      set than current one.
    - Or you can just transport it from inventory slot.
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - When level-up, don't forget to open your Glossary book at Build page and consume
      your Build Point.
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - The more percentage your weapon has an elemental bias, the more elemental damage
      than physical damage.
  - name: Hermes Haven
    sentences:
    - Every mob is more resistant to some elements and vulnerable to others.
